:"In Winter","original_title":"In Winter","overview":"In Winter follows a tired and isolated Goan immigrant in the UK, who starts to yearn for home, after a song from his childhood starts following him around. His longing to go home starts to affect reality..","poster_path":"/hUhtuTiLPTtkeJUwx1jwBf3Tij3.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[],"popularity":1.4317,"release_date":"2026-05-02","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0}]},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1303298,"known_for_department":"Camera","name":"Kelly Travis","original_name":"Kelly Travis","popularity":0.1895,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/a8ROQ0ATsV0y92D0kplsIqdXxCQ.jpg","id":28509,"title":"Komodo vs. Cobra","original_title":"Komodo vs. Cobra","overview":"A team of environmentalists, including a reporter, her camera man, and an environmentalist's famous girlfriend charter a boat and with the captain, sail to a military island. They suspect the island is hosting to illegal activities. Upon arrival, however, they find no one. They finally reach a deserted house, where they find Dr. Susan Richardson, who tells them that everyone on the island is dead, including her father. Richardson's team were working on a compound that could make edible plants grow to super size, however the military intervened with plans of their own. They wanted to test the compound's effects on animals, and proceeded to feed it to several komodo dragons and cobras.","poster_path":"/2dLwpe18MC3nIF5MmkWuB8waba9.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[27,878,10770],"popularity":1.5907,"release_date":"2005-08-19","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.072,"vote_count":69},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/slQkyiStcYezBZyeK2LdWcfKELb.jpg","id":70110,"title":"Turbulent Skies","original_title":"Turbulent Skies","overview":"When a new airplane that's equipped with a new computer that can fly the plane on its own, is about to have its first flight. But the son of the owner decides to upload more software, he doesn't bother to check if there are any viruses with it. And he also invites some potential investors to try it. So the plane appears to be working well but suddenly it veers off course and it can't be shut down. When the military learns of this and fears what if something happens if it's over a populated area; decides to shoot it down along with everyone on board. The man who built the computer whose wife is among the passengers thinks if he can get on board he might be able to shut it down and regain control of the plane. So the military using a new plane gets him on board. But what he didn't know is that both pilots are incapacitated so there's no one who can fly the plane.","poster_path":"/i5Q6MTFIg58oCjPIE20kDbi4uyQ.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[28,53,10770],"popularity":1.3136,"release_date":"2010-05-05","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.413,"vote_count":69},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/76hm9Opobsum55TLo36lBCaTdu1.jpg","id":26987,"title":"Christmas Do-Over","original_title":"Christmas Do-Over","overview":"Kevin just wants a normal Christmas with his son and ex-wife’s family—until a wish makes it Christmas every day. Caught in a festive loop, Kevin learns new talents and big lessons.","poster_path":"/51DoG45RuZCiXJc49MA6QUgX1FX.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[35,10751,14,10770],"popularity":1.0242,"release_date":"2006-12-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.7,"vote_count":46}]}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":19}